title: fastbrute
abstract: >-
  A throughput optimized tool that recovers the 5 character secret in the
  hashcat mode 4010 hash, with pure Python, C and C++ AVX2 and AVX-512, and
  Odin backends on one shared algorithm.
type: software
authors:
  - name: TajuC
